# review/07-rebind-staging-pending
profile own
scope.begin caller
scope.begin s
new a A
bind r a
defer s emit.label &r
scope.begin iteration1
new b B
rebind r b
scope.end iteration1
scope.begin iteration2
new c C
rebind r c
scope.end iteration2
new result R
exit.prepare s result
defer s fail typed Defer
scope.end s
assert.failure Defer
check CRCBA
scope.end caller
